[{"title":"效元相体 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"香丝压枕落玫瑰，忆得双文睡脸回。\n底事沉吟又如笑，与君刚在梦中来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29750,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠所欢","author":"王彦泓","text":"嚼花吹叶弄妆迟，笑把花枝唱竹枝。\n千蝶帐深萦午梦，九雏钗重困春笄。\n人夸艳极偏耽静，天遣情多莫讳痴。\n嫁得书生不无谓，缠头只索断肠诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29751,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"横塘","author":"王彦泓","text":"却持离泪下西轩，络纬秋声玉砌喧。\n行过回塘更添恨，绿荷犹自盖双鸳。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29752,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠端己时湘云在座","author":"王彦泓","text":"淡月帘栊画烛筵，燕台佳句柳枝怜。\n香盘腻发春云湿，酒入寒肌夜玉怜。\n眼媚暗流灯影外，唤声低彻枕函边。\n湘君一夕啼多少，染得衾斑似竹鲜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29753,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠云客","author":"王彦泓","text":"不为郎归不卷帘，碧莎春砌步纤纤。\n长裙书带同心结，斗帐歌声刮骨盐。\n险约最欢来意外，沉忧难讳到眉尖。\n斜阳欲度梅梢尽，才向红窗拂镜奁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29754,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠君锡即用其韵兼有以勉之","author":"王彦泓","text":"珍重闲情肯浪痴，一回踪迹几回思。\n目成歌席先偷笑，泪尽离衫未解携。\n此日碧桃三度窃，何处琼树一枝移。\n怜君正在花秾处，莫到成阴却恨迟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29755,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"病中柬友","author":"王彦泓","text":"忆别江皋酒半酣，病身全似再眠蚕。\n维摩斗室经旬掩，愿接枚生一快谈。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29756,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀杂咏 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"何处青林好卜居，布帆空载一船书。\n理文有象惭吞凤，避债无台敢食鱼。\n贫骨岂容仙药换，牢愁难借妙言除。\n临邛四壁今如此，谁更同时赋子虚。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29757,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀杂咏 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"旅梦初回百恨新，寸肠焚绝泪成冰。\n穷途易感如杨子，旧里难归似柏人。\n骏价有谁沽死骨，鲸波无分活枯鳞。\n多愁髀肉空如削，跃马何曾及病身。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29758,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀杂咏 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"梯攻百道是愁心，痛饮排愁肺病侵。\n无计散怀惟恸哭，难持孤愤寄登临。\n雪封客舍炊烟断，风度僧寮药气深。\n世味如茶尝欲遍，剩余残骨付哀吟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29759,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感怀杂咏 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"病骨巉岩又见春，石忧丛集未亡身。\n朋欢散尽清言绝，家信来疏恶梦频。\n永夜独醒如露鹤，他年相吊只秋蝇。\n蒲团欲觅消除法，心似惊波恨转新。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29760,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"强欢","author":"王彦泓","text":"悲来填臆强为欢，不觉花前有泪弹。\n阅世已知寒暖变，逢人真觉笑啼难。\n诗堪当哭狂何惜，酒果排愁病也拚。\n无限伤心倚棠树，东南枝下独盘桓。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29761,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"衢州见桔树累累","author":"王彦泓","text":"笑蹙长蛾熨齿酸，酒阑常记手掺掺。\n车边碧树垂朱颗，谁为天涯寄合欢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29762,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自悼","author":"王彦泓","text":"一片愁声四壁虫，劳劳鱼目五更钟。\n自知荀粲年华促，已分崔郊智画穷。\n灵药几时分月姊，绨袍端欲借天公。\n空堂泣下无人会，羞向瑟琶问吉凶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29763,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"日日有雨（时在漳南道中）","author":"王彦泓","text":"望见乡山一抹青，霎时风雨暗前汀。\n天公也似人哀怨，每到斜阳一泪零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29764,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"死别","author":"王彦泓","text":"三年珍重感怜才，此别应须到夜台。\n中路相抛悲复愧，几时还望墓田来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29765,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"客思","author":"王彦泓","text":"月照林乌露入船，也知鸳阁未成眠。\n闲窗烛剩犹针线，小榻香消尚管弦。\n歌罢定应悲悄悄，梦来须认路绵绵。\n回肠九曲何须道，此夕肠回几万千。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29766,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山行慰肩舆者","author":"王彦泓","text":"崚嶒石路悯舆徒，犹喜羸形似鹤癯。\n只恨载将愁万斛，无由轻卸却何如。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29767,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对花杂恸 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"琼香一片委轻埃，犹忆春时傍砌开。\n肠断江南陈叔宝，丽华身后恰归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29768,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对花杂恸 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"一度听歌几日哀，满前花事眼慵抬。\n红梨不识伤心客，犹倚东风送笑来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29769,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对花杂恸 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"分付庭花莫再开，卷帘无复玉人来。\n花神若也相哀念，为结连枝向墓台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29770,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途自叹","author":"王彦泓","text":"画屏人去锦鳞稀，愁见啼红染客衣。\n纵使到家仍是客，迢迢乡路为谁归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29771,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鳏绪三十二韵","author":"王彦泓","text":"映月荧荧烛，凝寒瑟瑟裯。\n残春添药椀，独夜减香篝。\n背立偷弹泪，低眠懒卸头。\n临风看蝶戏，听雨替花忧。\n脸薄三卮醉，蛾弯两笔愁。\n疑来开掣锁，梦好破鸣钩。\n玉箸辞征骑，金钱卜去舟。\n悔多翻自笑，怨极不能羞。\n泣尽重衫湿，悲来独茧抽。\n凉篸抛月簟，薄袖倚霜楼。\n怅望湔裙约，丁宁拾翠俦。\n长烟迷别浦，短照隔横沟。\n肺渴那堪疗，肠枯莫可搜。\n凄声传铁拨，欢字隐金彄。\n远眺心如结，卑栖命不犹。\n宜男那有验，绣佛本无求。\n院静钟难晓，宫深扇易秋。\n惊皇开远字，辛苦觅良邮。\n骇浪终危燕，愁霖实误鸠。\n忍看云髻样，空忆月眉修。\n冷榻悬红胜，虚房掩碧油。\n艳踪花径窈，香迹藓庭幽。\n自此悲陈事，从今惋独游。\n犹疑屏后语，真悔镜前谋。\n星月明相照，风波暗未休。\n路迢心胆嫩，书杳怨猜稠。\n解佩怜江芷，贻环识石榴。\n湖桥寻画舫，苑陌盼香鞦。\n遍踏蘼芜径，回穿杜若洲。\n寄花含晓露，题叶信春流。\n鲋壑鳏鳞滞，鸳溪比翼遒。\n支机和泪赠，珍重避牵牛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29772,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀韬仲秣陵并促归骑 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"春光漂荡别离天，心似游丝百尺牵。\n见说人归归雁后，那堪泪落落花前。\n南都翠黛宜为史，北里红笺定几篇。\n争似碧窗银烛夜，月痕依约话缠绵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29773,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄怀韬仲秣陵并促归骑 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"金堂不似桂堂深，十二轩窗黛色临。\n燕绕杏梁淹宿雨，蝶穿花榭澹朝阴。\n檀槽急语他年恨，蜡烛娇啼此夜心。\n寄语游缰归及早，东风催绿渐成林。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29774,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"小屏低榻浣衣家，几度论心掩碧纱。\n此日踏歌门外过，墙头认得刺桐花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29775,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"曾将玉蕊饷妆台，低枕亲闻暗麝来。\n争奈暮秋花事断，闲窗惊喜蜡梅开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29776,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"喜到眉端蹙更湾，天然娟媚不须删。\n笑供沉水和欢道，情暖长须似博山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29777,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"月澹花寒晓镜前，初凉天气懒孤眠。\n秋姿较比春姿艳，试看霜枫似杜鹃。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29778,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"底事秋天易得明，晓风帘外似人行。\n今宵月好须重晤，草草犹多未诉情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29779,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"关心日影转前墀，又到萧郎过院时。\n重向镜中看一遍，髻花删却半嫣枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29780,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"每到尊前百恨攒，意中人似画中看。\n亲过一盏休辞满，照见如花素影寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29781,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"凉月微星自抱衾，罗鞋点露曲廊深。\n丁宁蜡烛休垂泪，为照寻郎一寸心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29782,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其九","author":"王彦泓","text":"针线秋灯淡翠蛾，同心花样费描摩。\n明宵相赠今宵办，莫误欢期夕渡河。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29783,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十","author":"王彦泓","text":"花鸟钗头扤细风，水晶蝴蝶玉莲蓬。\n偏怜宛颈偎人处，两点柔蓝映退红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29784,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十一","author":"王彦泓","text":"生成羞怯性难除，却笑导途便揽袪。\n别有关心人不觉，好风偏为指罗裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29785,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十二","author":"王彦泓","text":"却要因循簟未铺，鹦哥传道画堂呼。\n风光瞥去销魂在，赢得惊心也胜无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29786,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十三","author":"王彦泓","text":"奉坠征衫泪一双，索居从此闭瑶窗。\n还愁梦里寻郎去，烟月凄迷隔暮江。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29787,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十四","author":"王彦泓","text":"残阳归去若为情，将息临歧有一声。\n想到碧窗携手地，月痕长见泪痕生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29788,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十五","author":"王彦泓","text":"半裹红巾泪语低，别离情味莫凄凄。\n鸳鸯守定双飞愿，一任惊波浪影齐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29789,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十六","author":"王彦泓","text":"折与梅花插帽檐，清霜寒沁玉尖尖。\n寻常只伴熏炉坐，今日迎欢乍出帘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29790,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十七","author":"王彦泓","text":"缺月横窗烛未销，卧闻清露滴寒蕉。\n悠扬别梦飘何处，谁托愁魂为一招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29791,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十八","author":"王彦泓","text":"风绉回塘乍雪消，谢娘牖户隔红蕉。\n殷勤更托西邻女，为约湔裙试一招。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29792,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其十九","author":"王彦泓","text":"所思迢递隔三湘，为绣长幡供法王。\n但是有情皆满愿，妙莲花说不荒唐。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29793,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二十","author":"王彦泓","text":"笑将裙带缚箜篌，更卸金钗当酒筹。\n此夜嫦娥最相羡，月轮斜照合欢裯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29794,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二十一","author":"王彦泓","text":"半睡花冠倦未除，枕棱钗溜点罗袪。\n玉郎何处潜来到，笑倩回灯整翠裾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29795,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二十二","author":"王彦泓","text":"绿珠歌篴截秋云，月皎霜高乍破唇。\n吹动客肠幽怨事，却凭风寄桂堂人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29796,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二十三","author":"王彦泓","text":"白描纨扇夹湘筠，鬓影斜笼浅露唇。\n非是见君多掩敛，不禁羞忸为旁人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29797,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二十四","author":"王彦泓","text":"手把琼钗叩绿筠，一声凄调激芳唇。\n萧郎半月无归耗，便似回文织恨人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29798,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和于氏诸子秋词 其二十五","author":"王彦泓","text":"处处风波逐枕衾，相看今又到秋深。\n千阑百就多辛苦，只愿君心似妾心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29799,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"忆著","author":"王彦泓","text":"忆著垂鬟覆额时，此生难负谢芳姿。\n半宵欢泪零残烛，十载离肠搅乱丝。\n相望莫辞千里隔，行踪惟许月明知。\n从今注定鸳鸯牒，一炷盟香一首诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29800,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"敛笑防疑意绪谐，背人佯不隐红鞋。\n分明簇蝶低鬟畔，认得花纹细股钗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29801,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"病榻香销半掩关，别离耽误一秋闲。\n近来本是梳头少，约髻红丝宛未殷。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29802,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"灯边调笑酒边嗔，寒透罗衫十月春。\n爱问插花时势样，阔眉松髻似何人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29803,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"弄药争花语笑稠，忽然幽事到心头。\n眉尖怕被同袍觉，强作无愁倍是愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29804,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"青鸟闲将病耗传，惹伊愁绝转生怜。\n今朝教向当窗见，已试梳头晓镜前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29805,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其六","author":"王彦泓","text":"墙阴绕遍却空还，烟树红扉不启关。\n解得檀郎生性否，暮钟时候怕身闲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29806,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其七","author":"王彦泓","text":"暂见花间滴泪频，断肠滋味一番新。\n匆匆风影惊分处，尚自回头嘱付人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29807,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杂记 其八","author":"王彦泓","text":"窄阑逢处不抬头，脸晕犹呈灭烛羞。\n翻忆未成欢爱日，一番相见一回眸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29808,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"别绪","author":"王彦泓","text":"忍泪尊前不敢弹，隔屏斜立见眉端。\n长途愿作云随梦，单枕难凭玉辟寒。\n自信功名关妾分，尽留颜色待君欢。\n归来会有红窗夜，免把离容再四看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29809,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"雁叫蛩吟断续闻，余酲解尽未宵分。\n罗衾宽甚浑无暖，枉煞香篝夕夕熏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29810,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"本为无聊借酒浇，酒边情况更无聊。\n不知怅望缘何事，但觉欢情日渐消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29811,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁 其三","author":"王彦泓","text":"午梦迷离带宿酲，寸肠愁事独惺惺。\n排愁剩有听歌处，到得听歌又泪零。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29812,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁 其四","author":"王彦泓","text":"进酒难如断酒难，几番温却又重寒。\n平生多少尊前恨，未到潘年鬓已皤。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29813,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣愁 其五","author":"王彦泓","text":"眼前璧月照琼枝，剪断牢愁进一卮。\n记得风流江左字，破瓜时节酷裁诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29814,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒悰 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"残日东风雪半庭，薄寒轻醉几时醒。\n连宵烛下闻裁胜，何处花前遇踏青。\n染袖不拼香漫灭，移灯长忆影娉婷。\n愁心只有吴歈觉，更向玲珑仔细听。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29815,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寒悰 其二","author":"王彦泓","text":"岁晏无聊别绪盈，一枝梅萼寄卿卿。\n浣纱衫袖年年湿，碧玉梳奁事事清。\n调态几曾因病减，鲜妍多是称情生。\n自怜身世凄凉足，单占名花第一名。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29816,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏旧","author":"王彦泓","text":"玉杵擎将蜀道行，不辞辛苦为云英。\n当年只觉成都近，未称琼浆一饮情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29817,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"栎园姨翁坐上预听名歌并观二剑即事呈咏","author":"王彦泓","text":"风流领袖词坛伯，早岁倾家耽结客。\n肝胆男儿四海空，却随长黛操歌拍。\n烈士从来定赏音，周郎顾曲况郎琴。\n谁知唐勒牢骚况，剩托清讴写壮心。\n萧疏襟寄嫌华屋，别向林塘选幽筑。\n摩诘轩窗俨画图，安昌帘幕传丝竹。\n练色知声第一流，檀痕亲掐教伊州。\n呼来绛树皆琼树，倚遍笙楼即镜楼。\n临川丽曲才人赋，慧业情钟兼妙悟。\n妖唱能传作者心，圆喉脆节如丝度。\n只字悠扬刻漏移，四筵倾耳尽支颐。\n红尘卷雾双鸾出，绣带迎风一燕吹。\n歌酣酒热来孤愤，画鼓渊渊金石韵。\n奋袂低昂雪腕催，满堂掩泣灯生晕。\n浊酒何人识信陵，感时悲事绪填膺。\n饮醇长夜非荒晏，映柱摩挲六尺冰。\n丈夫意概矜然诺，不惜如花换干莫。\n自是荆卿侠气深，非关石尉欢情薄。\n座隅有客百愁盈，更倚云和啭一声。\n试问清狂能酷似，也应知是谢家甥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29818,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徐云闲故姬遗照 其一","author":"王彦泓","text":"未许丹青涴玉颜，天然标格小梅边。\n由来绝色多难老，为要情人尽可怜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":29819,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}}]